# Acknowledgement: Reference: .dockerignore file syntax,
#   https://docs.docker.com/build/concepts/context/#dockerignore-files

# Never enters the build context. The two that matter:
# .env (would bake a laptop's DJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE into the image) and
# .venv/ (wrong interpreter, largest thing here). tests/ is deliberately not
# listed; only the test target copies it.
#
# Patterns anchor at the context root unless prefixed with **/.

.env
.env.*

.venv/
venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Generated at build or run time
staticfiles/
media/

# Test output
test-reports/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
junit.xml

.git/
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
*.md
